#   m010: 1 cusp, H1 = Z (+) Z/6, peripheral lattice O_K
# Apply the same IsTorsionFreeByCosetAction / NumberOfCusps /
# HomologyInvariants pipeline as Stage 1, against B7 and its own
# peripheral generators (also not yet sourced), once relsT7_forB7 and
